{"id":"17b0691a6d971aa3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-random.md","title":"Random Forcing","display":"df-random — Random Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-random","aliases":["58-df-random"],"display":"df-random — Random Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random — Random Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:\\mathcal P([0,1])\\rightharpoonup[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\lambda:\\mathcal P([0,1])\\rightharpoonup[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (Lebesgue measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\in V^2\">\\(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\in V^2\\)</span> (random-forcing poset defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random} \\vdash \\mathbb{B}_{\\mathrm{rand}} \\coloneqq \\left\\langle \\{B\\subseteq[0,1]\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)&gt;0\\},\\{\\langle B,C\\rangle\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(C,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)&gt;0\\land\\lambda(C)&gt;0\\land B\\subseteq C\\}\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random} \\vdash \\mathbb{B}_{\\mathrm{rand}} \\coloneqq \\left\\langle \\{B\\subseteq[0,1]\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)&gt;0\\},\\{\\langle B,C\\rangle\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(C,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)&gt;0\\land\\lambda(C)&gt;0\\land B\\subseteq C\\}\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Random forcing adds a random real.</li>\n<li>It is c.c.c. and preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda:\\mathcal P([0,1])\\rightharpoonup[0,\\infty]$ (Lebesgue measure, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:\\mathcal P([0,1])\\rightharpoonup[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\in V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random} \\vdash \\mathbb{B}_{\\mathrm{rand}} \\coloneqq \\left\\langle \\{B\\subseteq[0,1]\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)>0\\},\\{\\langle B,C\\rangle\\mid \\mathrm{Borel}(B,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(C,[0,1],\\tau)\\land\\lambda(B)>0\\land\\lambda(C)>0\\land B\\subseteq C\\}\\right\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1034,"backlinks":[{"id":"6dbaa6eab4e3857b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}$（随机 forcing，见 [[../batch08/58-df-random.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1036","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-random.md|58-df-random]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["68427bc628af9b8d","9375de7089953a2b"]}